            "turn_id": "d02-t1"
          },
          "false_positive_sources_research_needed": {
            "text": "For Russia's false positives in other European languages, the authors state that more research is needed to distinguish among immigration, tourism, and business as alternate sources of false-positive languages in digital datasets.",
